<title>USA: American Standard Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>American Standard Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>PISCATAWAY, N.J. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.73		    $0.57</p>
<p> Net			 57,000		   43,000</p>
<p> Sales		  1,485,000		1,316,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  78,200		   76,200</p>
<p>	     9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.10   profit	 $1.21</p>
<p> Net loss		  86,000   profit	89,000</p>
<p> Sales		  4,368,000		3,910,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  77,800		   74,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for the first nine months of 1996 include asset impairment losses predominantly from the write-down of goodwill as follows: air conditioning products, $121 million and plumbing products, $114 million.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
